    "notes": "The dataset entails 623 face-to-face surveys conducted in Mount Kilimanjaro, Tanzania, with four social actors: farmers (n=362), nature conservationists (n=50), tour guides (n=55), and tourists (n=156). It contains preferences for 25 context-specific nature's contributions to people (NCP), expression of two instrumental, two intrinsic, and sixteen relational values, and profile attributes.",
